        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_e586b30ef30a4b0bbed850022aece5ee",
      "statement": "ImplementSpec is the only production IJob, keyed `{owner}/{repository}#{issueNumber}` (the queue's dedupe token); its RunAsync prepares the workspace, builds an ImplementationAgent role, obtains an IChatClient from ProviderResolver, runs a prompt session, logs the resulting git status and agent response, and disposes the chat client when it is IDisposable.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/Agent/ImplementSpec.cs#L26-L61",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:84fbbd97c9046d4c5378462dbfd6845c248875028dbcf308e0e0e34ca954c8b6:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_b5872892c2ba477c9beb1ecccbaabc8d",
      "statement": "Workspace preparation is policy that lives in ImplementSpec, not Git: a static PrepareLock serializes it, it fetches origin, refuses to continue on any FindMirrorProblemAsync result, fast-forwards local main to origin/main, then uses `.sebastian/workspaces/<issueNumber>` on branch `sebastian/issue-<number>` — returning an existing worktree directory unchanged rather than recreating it, so prior uncommitted agent work survives.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/Agent/ImplementSpec.cs#L23-L110",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:86bbec1a3d390c1e3fc4ffd5af87da0c02c1829fe0e0b10e2528955fa5135dc9:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_cb52206b2cc3444bae9a76dbce7f03cb",
      "statement": "The agent layer separates fixed capability from per-run instruction: AgentRole.CreateAgent wraps an IChatClient with AsHarnessAgent over a Configure-provided options object, while ImplementationAgent.Configure sets static instructions, a single shell function built from a confined LocalShellExecutor (working directory confinement, clean environment, a regex deny-list blocking destructive, git push/reset/clean, gh and network commands, and a 10-minute timeout), filesystem file access with all approvals disabled, and disables file memory, web search, and any mode other than execute.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/Agent/Roles/AgentRole.cs#L9-L21",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:e2d2b6c0c99309c7dec3587883995176fc8a99bdd81cf401a4a77117dfd72565:"
        },
        {
