    {
      "id": "claim_c40316a32bc5469e8e32cc4d1c4fe6a8",
      "statement": "Every job runs under PrepareWorkspaceAsync, which serializes on a static SemaphoreSlim, fetches origin, rejects a working copy that is not on main, has uncommitted tracked changes, or has commits ahead of origin/main, then fast-forwards main and creates or reuses the worktree .sebastian/workspaces/<issue> on branch sebastian/issue-<n> — reusing an existing directory untouched so a previous run's uncommitted agent work survives.",
