    {
      "id": "claim_9d68564713104684b99db32225252214",
      "statement": "The agent hop is split between capability and instruction: ImplementationAgent configures the harness with one confined shell tool (clean environment, 10-minute timeout, regex deny-list covering destructive removes, network clients, `gh`, and `git push|reset|clean|checkout --`), file access rooted at the worktree with approvals disabled, web search and file memory disabled, and execute mode; while ImplementSpec.BuildPrompt supplies the per-run task, requirements, and a rule forbidding git commands, commits, pushes, and outside-workspace edits.",
