    {
      "id": "claim_64e3c9f54fe946c78963cacb97428db0",
      "statement": "A run produces no repository side effect beyond uncommitted files in the worktree: the job ends by reading `git status --short` there and emitting a single Information log line with the path, status, and agent response — the git layer exposes fetch, ff-only merge, worktree add/prune, and status but no commit, push, or pull-request operation, and the job never resolves GitHubService, so no result is written back to the issue.",
